          "hideComponent": "false",
          "rightMargin": "3",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Sep 10 2020 13:09:36 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h1><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Leading the Digital Shift: Nurse Executives Driving the Future of Care</span></span></span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Healthcare is experiencing a digital shift, and nurse executives are critical to its success. This webinar will feature a fireside chat with nursing leaders who are guiding organizations through change. Topics include integrating new technologies, preparing the workforce and addressing equity and ethics in digital adoption. Participants will gain insights into practical strategies, leadership priorities and what the future of digital care looks like for nursing.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><b>Learning objectives:</b></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The why: urgency for digital transformation</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The role of nurse executives</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">High-impact technologies in practice</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Vision and call to action</span></li>\n</ol>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Apr 09 2026 13:38:24 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "rightPadding": "2",
          "backgroundColor": "rgba(255,255,255,0)",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
